---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { privatePinyinProduct } from '../data/products/privatepinyin';

interface Props {
  lang?: 'en' | 'ja' | 'zh-Hant' | 'zh-Hans';
}

const { lang = 'zh-Hant' } = Astro.props;
const downloads = privatePinyinProduct.downloads;
const macDownload = downloads.find((item) => item.id === 'macos-pkg') ?? downloads[0];
const windowsDownload = downloads.find((item) => item.id === 'windows-exe');
const iosTestflight = privatePinyinProduct.iosTestflight;
const latestVersion = privatePinyinProduct.latestVersion;
const macVersion = macDownload.version;
const windowsVersion = windowsDownload?.version ?? latestVersion;
const inputSourceName = '猫栈拼音';

const copy = {
  'zh-Hant': {
    title: '下載 猫栈拼音',
    description: `下載 猫栈拼音（PrivatePinyin）測試版，包含 macOS ${macVersion}、Windows ${windowsVersion} 內測版與 iOS TestFlight 外部測試。`,
    kicker: 'Input Method Download',
    headline: '下載 猫栈拼音測試版。',
    intro:
      `macOS 版目前是 ${macVersion}；Windows 版是 ${windowsVersion} 內測包；iOS 版已開放 TestFlight 外部測試。macOS 安裝後請在系統輸入法設定裡加入「${inputSourceName}」（PrivatePinyin）。`,
    primaryButton: '下載 macOS PKG',
    back: '返回產品頁',
    backHref: privatePinyinProduct.zhHantProductPath,
    metaTitle: '下載檔案',
    releaseNotesTitle: '版本說明',
    releaseNotes: [
      `macOS ${macVersion} 新增 Writer V1，可主動使用本機 AI 進行禮貌改寫與中英互譯預覽；結果只供複製，不會自動替換原文。`,
      'Writer 模型約 1.1 GB，僅在使用者主動操作後從固定官方來源下載，下載與使用前都會校驗精確大小和 SHA-256。',
      'Writer 透過獨立簽名的 AI-09 Helper 在本機運行；嚴格隱私模式會停用並取消 Writer，失敗時不影響普通拼音與 AI Lite。',
      `Windows 內測版仍為 ${windowsVersion}，下載與功能說明維持不變。`,
      'macOS 安裝包已完成 Developer ID 簽名、Apple 公證與 stapling。'
    ],
    publicBadge: '公開測試',
    internalBadge: '內測版',
    downloadAction: '下載',
    checksum: 'SHA-256',
    metaLabels: ['Version', 'System', 'Size'],
    warning:
      '請只從 Station Cat 官方網站下載桌面安裝包。macOS 包目前只支援 Apple Silicon Mac，Intel Mac 暫不支援；Windows 版仍屬內測；iOS 測試版請透過官方 Apple TestFlight 連結加入。'
  },
  'zh-Hans': {
    title: '下载 猫栈拼音',
    description: `下载 猫栈拼音（PrivatePinyin）测试版，包含 macOS ${macVersion}、Windows ${windowsVersion} 内测版与 iOS TestFlight 外部测试。`,
    kicker: 'Input Method Download',
    headline: '下载 猫栈拼音测试版。',
    intro:
      `macOS 版目前是 ${macVersion}；Windows 版是 ${windowsVersion} 内测包；iOS 版已开放 TestFlight 外部测试。macOS 安装后请在系统输入法设置里加入「${inputSourceName}」（PrivatePinyin）。`,
    primaryButton: '下载 macOS PKG',
    back: '返回产品页',
    backHref: privatePinyinProduct.zhHansProductPath,
    metaTitle: '下载文件',
    releaseNotesTitle: '版本说明',
    releaseNotes: [
      `macOS ${macVersion} 新增 Writer V1，可主动使用本地 AI 进行礼貌改写与中英互译预览；结果只供复制，不会自动替换原文。`,
      'Writer 模型约 1.1 GB，仅在用户主动操作后从固定官方来源下载，下载与使用前都会校验精确大小和 SHA-256。',
      'Writer 通过独立签名的 AI-09 Helper 在本地运行；严格隐私模式会停用并取消 Writer，失败时不影响普通拼音与 AI Lite。',
      `Windows 内测版仍为 ${windowsVersion}，下载与功能说明保持不变。`,
      'macOS 安装包已完成 Developer ID 签名、Apple 公证与 stapling。'
    ],
    publicBadge: '公开测试',
    internalBadge: '内测版',
    downloadAction: '下载',
    checksum: 'SHA-256',
    metaLabels: ['Version', 'System', 'Size'],
    warning:
      '请只从 Station Cat 官方网站下载桌面安装包。macOS 包目前只支持 Apple Silicon Mac，Intel Mac 暂不支持；Windows 版仍属内测；iOS 测试版请通过官方 Apple TestFlight 链接加入。'
  },
  en: {
    title: 'Download Maozhan Pinyin',
    description: `Download Maozhan Pinyin (PrivatePinyin) test builds for macOS ${macVersion} and Windows ${windowsVersion}, or join the iOS external TestFlight group.`,
    kicker: 'Input Method Download',
    headline: 'Download Maozhan Pinyin test builds.',
    intro:
      `The macOS build is ${macVersion}, the Windows internal test build is ${windowsVersion}, and the iOS build is available through an external TestFlight group. After installing on macOS, add "${inputSourceName}" (PrivatePinyin) in System Settings > Keyboard > Input Sources.`,
    primaryButton: 'Download macOS PKG',
    back: 'Back to product page',
    backHref: privatePinyinProduct.productPath,
    metaTitle: 'Download files',
    releaseNotesTitle: 'Release notes',
    releaseNotes: [
      `macOS ${macVersion} adds Writer V1 for user-initiated local AI rewrite and Chinese-English translation previews. Results are copied explicitly and never replace text automatically.`,
      'The roughly 1.1 GB Writer model is downloaded only after an explicit action from a fixed official source, with exact size and SHA-256 verification before use.',
      'Writer runs locally through a separately signed AI-09 Helper. Strict privacy mode disables and cancels Writer, while failures leave ordinary pinyin and AI Lite unaffected.',
      `The Windows internal test build remains ${windowsVersion}; its download and feature information are unchanged.`,
      'The macOS installer is Developer ID signed, Apple notarized, and stapled.'
    ],
    publicBadge: 'Public test',
    internalBadge: 'Internal test',
    downloadAction: 'Download',
    checksum: 'SHA-256',
    metaLabels: ['Version', 'System', 'Size'],
    warning:
      'Download desktop installers only from the official Station Cat site. The macOS package supports Apple Silicon Macs only; Intel Macs are not supported yet. Windows remains an internal test, and iOS access is provided through the official Apple TestFlight link.'
  },
  ja: {
    title: '猫栈拼音 をダウンロード',
    description: `猫栈拼音（PrivatePinyin）の macOS ${macVersion}、Windows ${windowsVersion} 内部テスト版をダウンロードし、iOS TestFlight 外部テストにも参加できます。`,
    kicker: 'Input Method Download',
    headline: '猫栈拼音 テスト版をダウンロード。',
    intro:
      `macOS 版は ${macVersion}、Windows 内部テスト版は ${windowsVersion} です。iOS 版は TestFlight 外部テストで公開しています。macOS ではインストール後、システムの入力メソッド設定で「${inputSourceName}」（PrivatePinyin）を追加してください。`,
    primaryButton: 'macOS PKG をダウンロード',
    back: '製品ページへ戻る',
    backHref: privatePinyinProduct.jaProductPath,
    metaTitle: 'ダウンロードファイル',
    releaseNotesTitle: 'バージョン情報',
    releaseNotes: [
      `macOS ${macVersion} は Writer V1 を追加し、ユーザー操作によるローカル AI の丁寧な書き換えと中英翻訳プレビューに対応しました。結果が自動で原文を置き換えることはありません。`,
      '約 1.1 GB の Writer モデルは明示的な操作後に固定の公式配布元から取得し、使用前に正確なサイズと SHA-256 を検証します。',
      'Writer は署名済みの独立 AI-09 Helper でローカル実行します。厳格プライバシーモードでは停止され、障害時も通常入力と AI Lite に影響しません。',
      `Windows 内部テスト版は ${windowsVersion} のままで、ダウンロードと機能説明に変更はありません。`,
      'macOS インストーラーは Developer ID 署名、Apple 公証、stapling を完了しています。'
    ],
    publicBadge: '公開テスト',
    internalBadge: '内部テスト',
    downloadAction: 'ダウンロード',
    checksum: 'SHA-256',
    metaLabels: ['Version', 'System', 'Size'],
    warning:
      'デスクトップ版は Station Cat 公式サイトからのみダウンロードしてください。macOS は Apple Silicon Mac のみ対応し、Windows は内部テスト版です。iOS 版は公式 Apple TestFlight リンクから参加してください。'
  }
}[lang];

const iosCopy = {
  'zh-Hant': {
    badge: '外部測試',
    title: 'iOS TestFlight',
    description: '透過 Apple TestFlight 在 iPhone 或 iPad 安裝猫栈拼音測試版。',
    labels: ['Channel', 'Device', 'Delivery'],
    values: ['External Test', 'iPhone / iPad', 'Apple TestFlight'],
    action: '加入 iOS 外部測試'
  },
  'zh-Hans': {
    badge: '外部测试',
    title: 'iOS TestFlight',
    description: '通过 Apple TestFlight 在 iPhone 或 iPad 安装猫栈拼音测试版。',
    labels: ['Channel', 'Device', 'Delivery'],
    values: ['External Test', 'iPhone / iPad', 'Apple TestFlight'],
    action: '加入 iOS 外部测试'
  },
  en: {
    badge: 'External test',
    title: 'iOS TestFlight',
    description: 'Install the Maozhan Pinyin test build on iPhone or iPad through Apple TestFlight.',
    labels: ['Channel', 'Device', 'Delivery'],
    values: ['External Test', 'iPhone / iPad', 'Apple TestFlight'],
    action: 'Join the iOS external test'
  },
  ja: {
    badge: '外部テスト',
    title: 'iOS TestFlight',
    description: 'Apple TestFlight から iPhone または iPad に猫栈拼音テスト版をインストールできます。',
    labels: ['Channel', 'Device', 'Delivery'],
    values: ['External Test', 'iPhone / iPad', 'Apple TestFlight'],
    action: 'iOS 外部テストに参加'
  }
}[lang];

const canonicalPath =
  lang === 'zh-Hant'
    ? privatePinyinProduct.zhHantDownloadPagePath
    : lang === 'zh-Hans'
      ? privatePinyinProduct.zhHansDownloadPagePath
      : lang === 'ja'
        ? privatePinyinProduct.jaDownloadPagePath
        : privatePinyinProduct.downloadPagePath;
---

<BaseLayout
  title={copy.title}
  description={copy.description}
  lang={lang}
  canonicalPath={canonicalPath}
  ogImage={privatePinyinProduct.assets.icon}
  bodyClass="station-paper-page radar-page privatepinyin-page"
  alternates={[
    { hrefLang: 'zh-Hant', href: privatePinyinProduct.zhHantDownloadPagePath },
    { hrefLang: 'zh-Hans', href: privatePinyinProduct.zhHansDownloadPagePath },
    { hrefLang: 'en', href: privatePinyinProduct.downloadPagePath },
    { hrefLang: 'ja', href: privatePinyinProduct.jaDownloadPagePath },
    { hrefLang: 'x-default', href: privatePinyinProduct.zhHantDownloadPagePath }
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-shell">
    <p class="section-kicker">{copy.kicker}</p>
    <h1>{copy.headline}</h1>
    <p>{copy.intro}</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button-primary" href={macDownload.downloadPath}>{copy.primaryButton}</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href={iosTestflight.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{iosCopy.action}</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href={copy.backHref}>{copy.back}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="download-box radar-download-box">
    <h2>{copy.releaseNotesTitle}</h2>
    <ul class="privatepinyin-release-list">
      {copy.releaseNotes.map((note) => <li>{note}</li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="download-box radar-download-box">
    <h2>{copy.metaTitle}</h2>
    <div class="anytls-download-grid">
      {downloads.map((download) => (
        <article class="anytls-download-card">
          <div>
            <p class="section-kicker">{download.channel === 'internal-test' ? copy.internalBadge : copy.publicBadge}</p>
            <h3>{download.label}</h3>
            <p>{download.platform} · {download.architecture}</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="radar-meta-list">
            <div>
              <dt>{copy.metaLabels[0]}</dt>
              <dd>{download.version}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>{copy.metaLabels[1]}</dt>
              <dd>{download.minimumSystem}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>{copy.metaLabels[2]}</dt>
              <dd>{download.fileSize}</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <div class="checksum-block">
            <strong>{copy.checksum}</strong>
            <code>{download.sha256}</code>
          </div>
          <a class="button button-primary" href={download.downloadPath}>{copy.downloadAction} {download.platform}</a>
        </article>
      ))}
      <article class="anytls-download-card privatepinyin-testflight-card">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">{iosCopy.badge}</p>
          <h3>{iosCopy.title}</h3>
          <p>{iosCopy.description}</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="radar-meta-list">
          {iosCopy.labels.map((label, index) => (
            <div>
              <dt>{label}</dt>
              <dd>{iosCopy.values[index]}</dd>
            </div>
          ))}
        </dl>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={iosTestflight.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{iosCopy.action}</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p>{copy.warning}</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
